{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Buy, Battle, Repeat!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into Joust mode in Knight's Errand. Purchase units from the shop and take on other players' avatars in thrilling asynchronous battles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What to Expect in the Full Version</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adventure and Joust modes.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10+ factions with their unique armies and heroes.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">100+ units with passive perks and active abilities for each unit.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Several schools of magic each with their own spells.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Item-focused skill system for heroes.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wide progression system to unlock new heroes, units, items and spells.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo Content\u00a0\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Joust mode.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Human army faction.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">13 units with unique stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Currently only English is available. More languages coming soon! </p>","achievements":{"total":0},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3678830?t=1745769432","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3678830?t=1745769432","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678830/4f97ad65a7b9439c6a6c6bc109aeaa79590ac21d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745769432","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678830/4f97ad65a7b9439c6a6c6bc109aeaa79590ac21d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745769432","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"co